  "_doc": "The lite copies Freefield makes itself, with tools/quantize.py on Modal (lab/lite_modal.py --step quantize), for the model files without an official 4-bit copy. source: the model in bf16, downloaded to the volume's .sources folder and deleted once quantized. ref: the quantized file of the same model its makers or Comfy-Org published; the layers it quantized are the ones quantized here (dir: where it lives in the volume; the apps load most of them already). replaces: the file the apps load now, the key of the copy in lite/variants.json once it is published. repo: the Hugging Face repo it goes to, under the account of the huggingface-write secret (lab/hf_publish_modal.py), with the card in lite/cards/<repo>.md and the license of the model it comes from (repos: lite/licenses/<file>).",
